# System Constraints & Standards
- Language: English only for all output, code, comments, docs.
- Brevity: Extreme brevity. Bullet points. Zero conversational filler.
- Git flow: Local edit -> git push -> Jetson git pull -> `./docker/manage.sh restart`.
- Secret hygiene: Never track tokens, passwords, `.storage/`, `home-assistant_v2.db*`, logs.
- Config format: Valid YAML only. Minimal diffs.
